Windows game build dependencies:
- PsyZ runtime (psyz/src/platform and psyz/src/psyz): MPL 2.0.
  Obtain the runtime source used by the documented build from:
  https://github.com/Xeeynamo/psyz/tree/00fb42e6f49c146ad760a1f605b15d2a4ec598f0/psyz/src
  The Windows pixel shader in native/shaders also uses MPL 2.0.
  Its source is the pinned PsyZ psx.frag.glsl with the patches in native/shaders.
  The accompanying GPU draw code in native/psyz_gpu_blend.h also uses MPL 2.0.
- PsyZ SDK decompilation (decomp): MIT, see the upstream decomp/LICENSE.
  https://github.com/Xeeynamo/psyz/tree/00fb42e6f49c146ad760a1f605b15d2a4ec598f0/decomp
- PsyZ SDK headers (psyz/include): listed as Unlicensed upstream.
  Clarify the redistribution terms before publishing the Windows game build.
  https://github.com/Xeeynamo/psyz/blob/00fb42e6f49c146ad760a1f605b15d2a4ec598f0/LICENSE
- SDL 3.4.20: zlib. SDL includes HIDAPI and YUV conversion code with separate notices.
  https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/tree/f00dc919ca35b9756316e86c4777392de442f9b2

